_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 19
---
order: 19
---
short_label: VII.19
---
statement: If four numbers are proportional, then the number produced from the first and fourth equals the number produced from the second and third; and, if the number produced from the first and fourth equals that produced from the second and third, then the four numbers are proportional.
---
proof:

---
body:

